  "instructions": [
    "Grind the cumin seeds, coriander seeds, and red chili powder using a mortar and pestle into a fine powder.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a small non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the sun-dried tomatoes to the pan and sauté for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped walnuts to the pan and sauté for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add the bread crumbs, salt, and dried oregano to the pan and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Tear the iceburg lettuce leaves into shaggy pieces and add them to the pan.",
    "Mix well all the pan ingredients.",
    "Add the ground spice powder mixture to the pan and mix well.",
    "Add the water to the pan and mix well till a desired consistency is achieved.",
    "Transfer the salad to a serving plate, garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
